@@ -422,3 +480,75 @@ MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MagmaIntentToStealNotice:
 	.string "We will take the fuel no matter what.\p"
 	.string "“Let there be more land!\n"
 	.string "                                          TEAM MAGMA”$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_UnusualSignalBriefing:
+	.string "We've been observing something\n"
+	.string "unusual in the sky lately…\p"
+	.string "It's unlike anything we've\n"
+	.string "encountered before.\p"
+	.string "STEVEN is here. He can't take\n"
+	.string "his eyes off that white rock\n"
+	.string "outside.\p"
+	.string "If you would help us, we need\n"
+	.string "research on two fronts.\p"
+	.string "First: METEOR FALLS. Examine the\n"
+	.string "rocks where the meteorites bit\n"
+	.string "deep into the wall.\p"
+	.string "Second: a MOON STONE. LUNATONE\n"
+	.string "in the falls are said to carry\n"
+	.string "them.\p"
+	.string "The sky will not wait forever.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_AskMeteoriteExamination:
+	.string "The signal is still faint.\n"
+	.string "METEOR FALLS first, please.\l"
+	.string "the rocks where the meteorites\n"
+	.string "struck.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_AskMoonStone:
+	.string "So the falls' rocks told their\n"
+	.string "story. Now, a MOON STONE.\l"
+	.string "LUNATONE in the falls are said\n"
+	.string "to carry them.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_MoonStoneExamined:
+	.string "Oh! Is that a MOON STONE?\n"
+	.string "May I see it…?\p"
+	.string "Yes… faint traces of the same\n"
+	.string "signal, locked in the stone.\l"
+	.string "Thank you. This helps.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_AskReadingUpstairs:
+	.string "With the rocks and the stone\n"
+	.string "agreeing…\p"
+	.string "Please, the researcher upstairs\n"
+	.string "tends the main monitor.\l"
+	.string "Show him what we have.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_SignalMarkedDeepInFalls:
+	.string "The signal is marked now,\n"
+	.string "deep inside METEOR FALLS.\p"
+	.string "The researchers have opened the\n"
+	.string "way for you. Go and see.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_StevenExaminesWhiteRock:
+	.string "STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
+	.string "Interesting… This stone has an\n"
+	.string "unusual composition.\p"
+	.string "I've studied meteorites for\n"
+	.string "years, but I've never\n"
+	.string "encountered anything quite like\n"
+	.string "this.\p"
+	.string "It sits here as if it fell from\n"
+	.string "somewhere far beyond HOENN.\p"
+	.string "Perhaps there's something worth\n"
+	.string "investigating in METEOR FALLS.\p"
+	.string "If the scientists here need\n"
+	.string "help, I would not say no.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_StevenLooksToTheFalls:
+	.string "STEVEN: A white rock here, a\n"
+	.string "signal in the sky…\p"
+	.string "METEOR FALLS keeps its secrets\n"
+	.string "well. But not from you, I\n"
+	.string "think.$"
