 	.string "after this.\p"
 	.string "Oh, yes, I don't live in RUSTBORO CITY.\n"
 	.string "I live right here on this island.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_ReadingsConverged:
+	.string "The rocks of the falls, and the\n"
+	.string "stone… you've brought word of\n"
+	.string "both?\p"
+	.string "Then look. The readings…\n"
+	.string "they've converged!\p"
+	.string "A faint signal, steady as a\n"
+	.string "heartbeat, from deep inside\n"
+	.string "METEOR FALLS.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_SignalDeepInMeteorFalls:
+	.string "The researchers have marked the\n"
+	.string "spot and opened the hidden way\n"
+	.string "for you.\p"
+	.string "Go to METEOR FALLS, the deepest\n"
+	.string "room of the lower falls.\p"
+	.string "And {PLAYER}{KUN}… be careful.\n"
+	.string "What waits there may be a wish\n"
+	.string "that never got granted.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_ReadingsStillNoise:
+	.string "The readings are noise until\n"
+	.string "the rocks and the stone agree.\p"
+	.string "The researcher downstairs will\n"
+	.string "explain.$"
+
+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_ReadingDoneLine:
+	.string "The signal is yours to follow\n"
+	.string "now. METEOR FALLS awaits.$"
